{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 72,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        113.12979888916016,
        27.289522171020508,
        340.4130554199219,
        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "RECOMMENDATIONS FOR MANAGEMENT OF COMMON CHILDHOOD CONDITIONS",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        59.74208068847656,
        399.11297607421875,
        73.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "In developing countries where there could be a high rate of serious acute complications,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        72.74208068847656,
        399.04290771484375,
        86.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "such as mastoiditis, and where short-term and long-term complications of untreated",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        85.74208068847656,
        341.3328552246094,
        99.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "AOM can lead to death or severe disability, antibiotic use is beneficial.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        107.2359848022461,
        78.65290069580078,
        119.37598419189453
      ],
      "text": "Risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        120.24598693847656,
        399.03277587890625,
        133.73599243164062
      ],
      "text": "In a Cochrane review, use of antibiotics resulted in a 37% (95% CI 0.05 to 0.67)",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        133.24598693847656,
        399.0827331542969,
        146.73599243164062
      ],
      "text": "relative increase in risk of adverse events: 16% (110 out of 690) of children treated with",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        146.24598693847656,
        399.0328063964844,
        159.73599243164062
      ],
      "text": "antibiotics versus 11% (83 out of 711) of children treated with placebo experienced",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        159.24610900878906,
        399.0628662109375,
        172.73611450195312
      ],
      "text": "vomiting, diarrhoea, or rash. Others have reported antibiotics to cause adverse effects",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        172.24610900878906,
        213.70294189453125,
        185.73611450195312
      ],
      "text": "in 4% to 10% of children [Coker, 2010].",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        196.7646942138672,
        205.31298828125,
        208.75469970703125
      ],
      "text": "8.2.3\t Acceptability and feasibility",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        212.41929626464844,
        396.8504943847656,
        225.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "Until there is more direct evidence specifically addressing the effectiveness of anti­",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        225.41929626464844,
        396.8504943847656,
        238.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "biotics in children with AOM in developing countries, and the safety of withhold­",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        238.41929626464844,
        399.0528259277344,
        251.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "ing them, it would not be safe to withhold antibiotics. There is a high incidence of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        251.41929626464844,
        399.07281494140625,
        264.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "possible complications; the ‘watch and wait’ approach of not giving antibiotics and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        264.4192810058594,
        399.1029052734375,
        277.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "observation is limited in developing countries by poor systems for follow-up, poor",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        277.4192810058594,
        263.99285888671875,
        290.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "access to health facilities, and resource limitations.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        290.4192810058594,
        399.09136962890625,
        303.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "Implementation of this recommendation exists based on the fact that it is feasible",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        303.4192810058594,
        399.0927734375,
        316.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "to distribute oral amoxicillin in resource-limited settings as it is available in tablet",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        316.4192810058594,
        399.052734375,
        329.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "and suspension form in all countries. Oral amoxicillin is the recommended treatment",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        329.4192810058594,
        336.19287109375,
        342.9093017578125
      ],
      "text": "for non-severe pneumonia, and should therefore be widely accessible.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        352.9668884277344,
        388.3540954589844,
        366.1558837890625
      ],
      "text": "8.3\t Antibiotic treatment for Chronic Suppurative Otitis Media (CSOM)",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        369.5924987792969,
        399.1029052734375,
        383.08251953125
      ],
      "text": "a)\t Children with chronic suppurative otitis media (CSOM) should, in addition to aural",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        382.5924987792969,
        399.05145263671875,
        396.08251953125
      ],
      "text": "toilet by dry wicking, be treated with instillation of drops containing quinolones",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        395.5924987792969,
        374.7613830566406,
        409.08251953125
      ],
      "text": "(such as ciprofloxacin, norfloxacin, ofloxacin) three times daily for two weeks.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        410.9971923828125,
        252.91282653808594,
        424.9172058105469
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, low quality evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        427.26177978515625,
        399.0927734375,
        440.7518005371094
      ],
      "text": "b)\tChildren who fail to respond to treatment should be referred for further evaluation",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        440.26177978515625,
        270.08154296875,
        453.7518005371094
      ],
      "text": "for other causes of CSOM, especially tuberculosis.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        455.66650390625,
        229.02288818359375,
        469.5865173339844
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, expert opinion)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        480.4250183105469,
        91.77291107177734,
        492.56500244140625
      ],
      "text": "Remarks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        493.43499755859375,
        399.08294677734375,
        506.9250183105469
      ],
      "text": "The duration of treatment was not clear from studies and depended on clinical",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        506.43499755859375,
        399.11297607421875,
        519.9249877929688
      ],
      "text": "circumstances, therefore the panel could not make a definitive recommendation",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        519.4349975585938,
        399.1129150390625,
        532.9249877929688
      ],
      "text": "on the duration of treatment. It was noted that the price of ciprofloxacin varies",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        532.4349975585938,
        399.0627746582031,
        545.9249877929688
      ],
      "text": "widely across different countries, and in some settings it may not be the cheapest",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        545.4349975585938,
        399.0228576660156,
        558.9249877929688
      ],
      "text": "fluoroquinolone and therefore necessitates the recommendation of any of the other",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        558.4349975585938,
        211.25294494628906,
        571.9249877929688
      ],
      "text": "available alternative fluoroquinolones.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        582.9535522460938,
        231.48292541503906,
        594.943603515625
      ],
      "text": "8.3.1\t Evidence and summary of findings",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        598.6082763671875,
        399.1327819824219,
        612.0982666015625
      ],
      "text": "Two systematic reviews of antibiotic therapy for CSOM in children were identified:",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        611.6082763671875,
        396.8504943847656,
        625.0982666015625
      ],
      "text": "one compared topical versus systemic antibiotics and the other compared the effec­",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        222.39259338378906,
        644.9403076171875,
        230.65460205078125,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "58",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}